// One near line can outrank the eight when it fits.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE near ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1
CUBE eight ROLE observer PROTON 1

PLUG near eight

IMPULSE near 1
IMPULSE eight 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY eight
DECIDE eight
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "nearline" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
